message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
  Authors are listed by the number of lines they committed, then by the
  number of their commits; equal contributors, if any, are listed
  alphabetically by family name and marked with an asterisk (*) after their
  family names. To add or correct your entry, open an issue or a pull
  request.
title: DRS-Filer
abstract: >-
  DRS-Filer is a microservice that implements the GA4GH Data Repository
  Service (DRS) API, so that clients such as workflow engines and execution
  services can resolve data objects by their IDs, and get their metadata,
  checksums and the URLs to access them. Additional endpoints list,
  register, update and delete objects and set the service info. It is built with FOCA
  and deployed with Docker Compose or its Helm chart.
